IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-STAR-ATTENTION.

DATA DIVISION.
01 LOCAL-TOKENS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 CLUSTER-NODES       PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 ANCHOR-TOKENS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 CONTEXT-LEN-K       PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-STAR-ATTENTION.
    IF LOCAL-TOKENS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF CLUSTER-NODES == 0
        MOVE 8 TO CLUSTER-NODES.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 128 TO ANCHOR-TOKENS.
    MOVE LOCAL-TOKENS TO CONTEXT-LEN-K.
    MULTIPLY CLUSTER-NODES BY CONTEXT-LEN-K.
    DIVIDE 1024 INTO CONTEXT-LEN-K.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 CONTEXT-LEN-K.
    WEIGHT 30 ANCHOR-TOKENS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
